summary: Test bare NVIDIA driver installation
description: |
  Verify that installing nvidia without a version selects the latest
  available driver stack and a kernel module for the running kernel variant.
  Use mock RPMs to exercise package selection and dependency resolution
  without requiring NVIDIA hardware or installing functional drivers.
environment+:
  RADII: radii
require:
  - dnf-plugins-core
  - type: library
    nick: radii
    name: /Library/mock-rpms
